    <title></title>
    <link href="/2023/04/04/%E7%9E%8E%E5%86%99%E5%90%88%E9%9B%86/"/>
    <url>/2023/04/04/%E7%9E%8E%E5%86%99%E5%90%88%E9%9B%86/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之瞎写合集"><a href="#这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之瞎写合集" class="headerlink" title="这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之瞎写合集"></a>这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之瞎写合集</h1><h2 id="英文"><a href="#英文" class="headerlink" title="英文"></a>英文</h2><ol><li>As she awaits from the long sorrow, as fair her hair sets under thee tree. Years roar through her, still as her hair sets, with fair and care.</li><li>In dusty hope, she waits. Then there comes the long sorrow, then silence. Greet me with tears and fear for the journey is long and full of harm. All the waiting in dark shall not be seen but for your soul shall be redeemed.</li><li>I’ll see you in eighties.</li></ol><h2 id="中文"><a href="#中文" class="headerlink" title="中文"></a>中文</h2><ol><li>终究有一天,留在记忆里的只剩记忆本身。</li><li>18岁，想到了50岁的自己，不觉一阵厌恶与悲哀。</li><li>25岁，$20m^2$的公寓，女友，猫，还有琴。</li><li>你像15岁时候的阳光一样好看，第一次见你，就得把你从记忆深处拽出来。</li></ol>]]></content>
    
    
    
