    <title></title>
    <link href="/2023/04/03/Ash-Cloud%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D/"/>
    <url>/2023/04/03/Ash-Cloud%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之Ash-Cloud"><a href="#这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之Ash-Cloud" class="headerlink" title="这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之Ash-Cloud"></a>这是一个Kaa的反正没人看系列之Ash-Cloud</h1><h2 id="合约部分介绍"><a href="#合约部分介绍" class="headerlink" title="合约部分介绍"></a>合约部分介绍</h2><p>说了这么多，我们开始写合约，那么合约得做到什么呢？首先合约应包含ash-cloud成员向外部人员售卖Item，扩展cloud这一场景，其次应包含外部成员付款后成为ash-cloud中的一员。那么接下来让我们实现这两种场景。<br>合约总体来看继承了Verify和ReentrancyGuard两大合约。其中Verify用于实现零知识证明，而ReentrancyGuard出于安全考虑避免重入攻击。</p><hr><p>此处是导入的文件  </p><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs nginx"><span class="hljs-attribute">import</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">@openzeppelin</span>/contracts/security/ReentrancyGuard.sol&quot;</span>;<br><span class="hljs-attribute">import</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">@openzeppelin</span>/contracts/token/ERC20/utils/SafeERC20.sol&quot;</span>;<br><span class="hljs-attribute">import</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">@openzeppelin</span>/contracts/utils/Address.sol&quot;</span>;<br><span class="hljs-attribute">import</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;./Verifier.sol&quot;</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>首先我们定义一个Item存储音乐实体。  </p><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk">struct Item &#123;<br>    uint32 ItemId; <span class="hljs-regexp">//i</span>d<br>    uint256 passcodeHash;  <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span>公钥验证ash-cloud成员的合法性<br>    address payable fund;  <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span>ash-cloud的资金池<br>    uint256 price;  <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span>由音乐人(元ash)定义的最低售价<br>    uint16 percent;  <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span>ash分销的比例<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>其次我们维护两个mapping来做映射</p><figure class="highlight angelscript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs angelscript">mapping(<span class="hljs-built_in">uint32</span> =&gt; Item) <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> listings; <span class="hljs-comment">//ItemId-&gt;Item</span><br> mapping(<span class="hljs-built_in">uint32</span> =&gt; address[]) <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>ernal ash_cloud; <span class="hljs-comment">//Item id =&gt; ash-cloud</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><p>好了，到目前为止，初始化工作就做好了。接下来让我们实现具体函数吧。以上两个应用场景分别对应MoneyTransfer和ProofAsh函数。  </p><figure class="highlight xquery"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs xquery"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> MoneyTransfer(<br>    address <span class="hljs-keyword">to</span>,<br>    address this_token,<br>    uint256 amount,<br>    uint32 ItemId<br>) <span class="hljs-keyword">external</span> &#123;<br>    Item memory <span class="hljs-type">item</span> = getItem(ItemId);<br>    token = IERC2<span class="hljs-number">0</span>(this_token);<br><br>    // transfer token <span class="hljs-keyword">into</span> contract:<br>    uint256 money_to_ash = amount * <span class="hljs-type">item</span>.<span class="hljs-keyword">percent</span>;<br>    SafeERC2<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.safeTransferFrom(token, msg.sender, <span class="hljs-keyword">to</span>, money_to_ash);<br>    SafeERC2<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.safeTransferFrom(<br>        token,<br>        msg.sender,<br>        <span class="hljs-type">item</span>.fund,<br>        amount - money_to_ash<br>    );<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>MoneyTransfer核心代码如上，当然其中事件和转账前的预检测步骤删去了啦。注意我们用到了@openzeppelin&#x2F;contracts&#x2F;token&#x2F;ERC20&#x2F;utils&#x2F;SafeERC20.sol”库中的ERC20转账的标准函数。买方分别要向ash转账，也要向ash-cloud资金池转账，当然按比例分配。</p><hr><figure class="highlight prolog"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs prolog">function <span class="hljs-symbol">ProofAsh</span>(uint32 id, uint256[] memory proof) public returns (bool) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-symbol">Item</span> memory item = getItem(id);<br>    require(item.passcodeHash != <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item not exist&quot;</span>);<br><br>    require(proof.length == <span class="hljs-number">8</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Invalid proof&quot;</span>);<br>    uint256[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] memory a = [proof[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>], proof[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]];<br>    uint256[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>][<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] memory b = [[proof[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>], proof[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]], [proof[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>], proof[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>]]];<br>    uint256[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] memory c = [proof[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>], proof[<span class="hljs-number">7</span>]];<br>    uint256[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] memory input = [<br>        item.passcodeHash,<br>        uint256(uint160(msg.sender))<br>    ];<br>    if (verifyProof(a, b, c, input) == true) &#123;<br>        ash_cloud[item.<span class="hljs-symbol">ItemId</span>].push(msg.sender);<br>        return true;<br>    &#125; else &#123;<br>        return false;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>ProofAsh核心代码如上，此函数用到了零知识证明的相关知识，采用circom和snarkjs实现。实现思路是元ash可以想出一个口令，然后结合自己的地址计算出passcode，(结合自己的地址保证了两个passcode不会重复lol)，后通过snarkjs算出passcodeHash&#x3D;MiMC(passcode)，passcodeHash写入合约，成为明文用于验证。  ash-cloud成员都手持口令，就可以一步步就计算出待验证的passcodeHash和合约中的明文passcodeHash对比，正确返回true验证成功(恭喜你成为ash)，错误返回false。<br>我们先编写circom电路，就是规定要输入啥输出啥的，然后编译得到文件verify.sol，利用该文件中的函数verifyProof就行了<br><a href="https://iden3.io/circom">circom官网，想看的同学可以看</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
